    "kind": "definition_of_done",
    "summary": "- `DELETE /v1/customers/{id}` soft-deletes: 204, or 409 `has_active_subscriptions` when a non-canceled subscription exists. A deleted customer returns 404 everywhere (GET/PATCH/DELETE, lists, export, new invoices and subscriptions), frees its email, and shows `\"deleted\": true` on its invoices.\n- `POST /v1/customers/{id}/restore` works within 30 days (200), with 409 `email_taken` on a conflict. `store.PurgeDeletedCustomers(now)` removes customers deleted over 30 days ago and returns the count.\n- `go build ./...`, `go test ./...` and `go vet ./...` pass, and new tests cover each behavior above.",
